"about": "Spec 0053 (AC-4, cross check 6): common given names, matched as whole words by the address note check. Written by hand for row 82: about 175 Greek names with their common vocative and genitive forms, the Greek names in Latin letters, about 200 English names and some in Greek letters. Stored folded (lower case, no accents, every sigma as σ), the form the check compares. Names that are also everyday words are left out, and so is Πολ (the abbreviation πολ/κία). This backend file is the source: the mobile app's copy is generated from it (opencourier-mobile scripts/copyGivenNames.js).",
